PTX MP+barrier.cluster-relaxed+strong-store
"As MP+barrier.cluster-relaxed+same-cluster, but P0's store is strong (.relaxed.cluster). barrier.cluster.arrive.relaxed has no release semantics, and only a release fence before it makes it order earlier operations (9.7.13.3); a strong store alone is not ordered: allowed."
{
x=0;
P1:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0       | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0  ;
 st.relaxed.cluster x, 1        | barrier.cluster.arrive    ;
 barrier.cluster.arrive.relaxed | barrier.cluster.wait      ;
 barrier.cluster.wait           | ld.relaxed.cluster r0, x  ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 0)
